WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.565
The target uses facilities
the agency already has:

2
00:00:03.565 --> 00:00:08.000
the primary data center, the recovery
site, and ten regional hubs.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.673
Two distribution points per hub gives
twenty-four, with capacity for ninety-six

4
00:00:12.673 --> 00:00:17.700
thousand clients, which is seventy-three
percent used at seventy thousand endpoints.

5
00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:20.586
Regional servers pull from
the two data centers,

6
00:00:20.586 --> 00:00:24.338
so the fan-out is two to twenty
instead of one to fifteen hundred.

7
00:00:24.338 --> 00:00:27.566
Each field office gets a
sized internet circuit,

8
00:00:27.566 --> 00:00:31.199
a five-G backup for continuity
only, and no local server.

9
00:00:31.199 --> 00:00:34.990
The design adds two servers per
eight thousand new endpoints.
